      "id": "event-aipc-2026",
      "title": "All India Pastors Conference (AIPC) 2026: Proclaiming Christ Faithfully",
      "slug": "aipc-2026-proclaiming-christ-faithfully",
      "shortDescription": "The premier annual national gathering of pastors, elders, church planters, and theological students from across India.",
      "fullDescription": "### Conference Theme: Proclaiming Christ Faithfully in the 21st Century\n\nThe All India Pastors Conference (AIPC) 2026 gathers pastors, leaders, and servants of Christ for three intensive days of biblical instruction, expository sermons, pastoral fellowship, and mutual encouragement.\n\n#### Key Highlights\n- **Plenary Expository Addresses** through the Pastoral Epistles.\n- **Breakout Workshops** on hermeneutics, sermon preparation, church discipline, and biblical counseling.\n- **Pastoral Q&A Panels** addressing the contemporary challenges of shepherding local churches in India.\n- **Bookstall & Literature Grants** offering discounted and gifted sound theological resources.",
      "featuredPosterUrl": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511795409834-ef04bbd61622?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&h=800&q=80",
